This snapshot includes Baseline S in two inference formats:
models/baseline_s.onnx (FP32) and models/baseline_s.int8.onnx (mixed precision).
The latter is derived from the former by scripts/quantize_model.py and
inherits the same provenance and rights limitations.
Its graph identifiers were normalized for publication; this does not hide
the graph topology, operators or learned weights. Model slots M and L have
no implementation or artifacts in this snapshot.

